  [117] getlocal 0 .............................. <IntX>
  [119] pushint8 111 ............................ <111>
  [122] lteq .................................... <IntX <= 111>
  [123] jmpifz [147] ............................ repeat while IntX <= 111
  [126] getlocal 0 .............................. <IntX>
  [128] pusharglist 1 ........................... <IntX>
  [130] extcall 47 .............................. <sprite(IntX)>
  [133] pushzero ................................ <0>
